{'symbol': 'ETR', 'date': '2022-04-11 13:34:00', 'title': 'ENTERGY ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT TO SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': "NEW ORLEANS , APRIL 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ENTERGY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $1.01 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JUNE 1, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 5, 2022."}